    "method": {
      "advance": "For a statistical follow-up, preserve all useful current locations, recover at least two additional groups across both generation families and add at most one false-flag group to same-window agreement on the later dated human revisions. Before-versus-self is only a scope control. A single publisher remains development evidence. No serving confidence change.",
