      "combined": "Compare changed-agreement selection with or without an additional paired-direction focus.",
      "controls": "Before and after versions of the exact source excerpt are dated ordinary-writing controls. Use one generated replacement of the before center from each independently pinned model. Require a valid single output and preserve all flanking sentences.",
