      "geometry": "Compare the actual app draft comparator's exact changed-token ranges as source evidence. An ordinary author revision is a genuine difference and never an AI attribution.",
      "outcomes": "Useful generated localization requires .30 non-whitespace character IoU and at least .50 recall. Count exact focus, wrong-only and missed separately. For genuine controls report group-level flags and distinguish exact unchanged native inputs from changed inputs and changed focus.",
